# The Take control in the on-air controls row: starts the take flow with the panel directly under the on-air section, then the tray's nine glyphs in three rows of three.
# Demo mode (AUTORADIO_DEMO=1), launch default AutoradioDemoSheet = day. @S@ is the shots directory. Real driver ops only.
clock +1500 real
tree
tap radio-play
clock +3500 real
tree
tap radio-take-start
clock +2500 real
tree
screenshot @S@/T01-recording.png
clock +2000 real
tap takes-stop
clock +2500 real
tree
screenshot @S@/T02-review.png
tap bar-mark
clock +900 real
tree
screenshot @S@/T03-tray.png
